error: `SocketAddress.lookup` holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  `SocketAddress.lookup` waits for a name to be looked up
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_udp_lookup_in_async.sg:2:35
 2 |     var found = try SocketAddress.lookup("localhost:53")
   |                                   ^^^^^^
  hint: `await SocketAddress.lookupAsync("localhost:53")` does the same work without holding the thread
